Verse 1:
[Db]O Master, [Gb]let [Db]me [Ebm]walk [Eb]with [Ab]Thee
In [Bbm7]low[Ab7]ly[Db]paths [Bbm7]of[Eb]service [Ab]free;
[Ab7]Tell me thy [Db]secret; [Gb]help [Db]me [Ebm]bear
[Db]The [Ab7]strain [Bbm]of[Ab7]toil, [Db]the [Ebm]fret [Ab]of [Db]care.

Verse 2:
[Db]Help [Gb]me [Db]the slow [Ebm]of [Eb]heart [Ab]to move
[Bbm7]by [Ab7]some [Db]clear, [Bbm7]winning [Eb]word [Ab]of love;
[Ab7]teach [Db]me [Gb]the wayward [Db]feet [Ebm]to stay,
[Db][Ab7]and [Bbm]guide [Ab7]them [Db]in [Ebm]the [Ab]homeward [Db]way.

Verse 3:
[Db]Teach [Gb]me [Db]thy [Ebm]patience; [Eb]still [Ab]with thee
[Bbm7][Ab7]in [Db]closer, [Bbm7][Eb]dearer [Ab]company,
[Ab7]in [Db]work that [Gb]keeps [Db]faith sweet [Ebm]and strong,
[Db][Ab7]in [Bbm]trust [Ab7]that [Db][Ebm]triumphs [Ab]over [Db]wrong;

Verse 4:
[Db]In [Gb]hope [Db]that [Ebm]sends [Eb]a [Ab]shining ray
[Bbm7]far [Ab7]down [Db]the [Bbm7]future's [Eb]broadening [Ab]way,
[Ab7]in [Db]peace [Gb]that only [Db]thou [Ebm]canst give,
[Db][Ab7]with [Bbm]thee, [Ab7]O [Db]Master, [Ebm]let [Ab]me [Db]live.
